CORE
bound_dereference.c
--pointer-check --show-properties
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Property main\.pointer_dereference\.\d+:$
dereference failure: pointer NULL in \*count
^Property main\.precondition_instance\.\d+:$
static array parameter x must provide access to its declared minimum
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The generated precondition uses the static bound expression, and its pointer
access receives one deduplicated set of ordinary call-site pointer checks.
